       <div class="ch"><h1>Half-Wave Rectifier</h1><div class="ch-card"><h2>How it works</h2><ul><li><strong>V1:</strong> 5 V, 50 Hz sine source</li><li><strong>D1:</strong> passes only the positive half-cycles</li><li><strong>C1 (10 uF):</strong> smooths the output, <strong>R1 (1 kΩ):</strong> load</li></ul></div><div class="ch-formula">Vout ≈ Vpeak - 0.7 V (diode drop)</div></div>
    </div>
    </div></foreignObject></g>